{"3080880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "XiuzhenWorld2", "steam_appid": 3080880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Version Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is an outdated version of the game and is not recommended for new players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Switch to the New Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As a reward for veteran players, the game will be synced with the version of &lt;CultivationMagicWorld&gt;. After the initial sync, subsequent syncs will only occur when major updates are released.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Achievements and cloud saves are not available in this version)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In your Steam Library, right-click the game: **Properties** -&gt; **Betas** -&gt; Enter the code: 123456789666 -&gt; **Confirm**.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>XiuzhenWorld2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《XiuzhenWorld2》is a 3D world where your goal is to level up from a mere mortal into an immortal at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its a semi-idle game with fun immortal cultivation mechanics such as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- leveling up to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- capturing monsters as pets to fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- killing monsters &amp; comparing the stats of different equipment loot you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- over 10 different combat skills which get unlocked as you level up to kill monsters even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- upgrading your weapons to become more powerful with currency you collect from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- opening treasure chests which drop from monsters, these treasure chests provide random drops, see how lucky you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Reincarnation to come back stronger with better base stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game comes with a built-in AFK(Away From Keybourd) function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Version Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is an outdated version of the game and is not recommended for new players.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Switch to the New Version</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As a reward for veteran players, the game will be synced with the version of &lt;CultivationMagicWorld&gt;. After the initial sync, subsequent syncs will only occur when major updates are released.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>(Achievements and cloud saves are not available in this version)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In your Steam Library, right-click the game: **Properties** -&gt; **Betas** -&gt; Enter the code: 123456789666 -&gt; **Confirm**.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>XiuzhenWorld2</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《XiuzhenWorld2》is a 3D world where your goal is to level up from a mere mortal into an immortal at the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its a semi-idle game with fun immortal cultivation mechanics such as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- leveling up to become stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- capturing monsters as pets to fight for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- killing monsters &amp; comparing the stats of different equipment loot you get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- over 10 different combat skills which get unlocked as you level up to kill monsters even faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- upgrading your weapons to become more powerful with currency you collect from monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- opening treasure chests which drop from monsters, these treasure chests provide random drops, see how lucky you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Reincarnation to come back stronger with better base stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The game comes with a built-in AFK(Away From Keybourd) function.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "《XiuzhenWorld2》is a 3D world where your goal is to level up from a mere mortal into an immortal at the end. Its a semi-idle game with fun immortal cultivation mechanics such as - leveling up to become stronger. - capturing monsters as pets to fight for you. - AFK(Away From Keybourd).", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080880/header.jpg?t=1768127359", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080880/530cbca891f79f41bff9bb61c9f32bb2b2263de8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768127359", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080880/530cbca891f79f41bff9bb61c9f32bb2b2263de8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768127359", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3-9100F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</st